Problem Solving Page Design After claude/

# ── Internal planning docs (kept out of a public repo) ───────
# The scale-readiness programme documents unfixed security findings, live
# infrastructure details, and internal cost/negotiation notes. Keep these out
# of git while the repository is public. If the repo is made private, consider
# tracking them again — Chapters 16–18 are the runbook and incident playbooks,
# and they are only useful if the whole team can reach them.
docs/scale-readiness/
# Compiled export of the same programme — excluding the source folder achieves
# nothing if the assembled document is committed alongside it.
docs/CodeMentor-Scale-Readiness-Programme.docx
docs.zip
